{"page": "loans-consolidation", "pinned_ref": "7e6b993ef", "template": "<div class=\"card\" id=\"debt-manager\">\n        <h3>{{.heading_1}}</h3>\n        <div id=\"debt-list\">\n            <div class=\"debt-row\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"d-name-1\" placeholder=\"e.g. Credit Card\" class=\"d-name\">\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"d-bal-1\" placeholder=\"Balance (£)\" class=\"d-bal\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"d-rate-1\" placeholder=\"APR (%)\" class=\"d-rate\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"d-months-1\" placeholder=\"Months Left\" class=\"d-months\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n                <span></span> </div>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"btn-add-debt\" onclick=\"addDebtRow()\" style=\"margin-top:15px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">{{.button_1}}</button>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n        <h3>{{.heading_2}}</h3>\n        <div class=\"input-grid\">\n            <div>\n                <label>{{.label_1}}</label>\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"new-rate\" value=\"9.9\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <label>{{.label_2}}</label>\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"new-term\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"comparison-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card-red\">\n            <h4>{{.heading_3}}</h4>\n            <p>Total Debt to Clear: <strong id=\"curr-total-bal\">£0.00</strong></p>\n            <p>Total Remaining Interest: <strong id=\"old-int\">£0.00</strong></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-green\">\n            <h4>{{.heading_4}}</h4>\n            <p>New Monthly Payment: <strong id=\"new-monthly\">£0.00</strong></p>\n            <p>Total Interest Cost: <strong id=\"new-int\">£0.00</strong></p>\n            <div id=\"verdict\" class=\"verdict-text\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<script src=\"/assets/js/calculators.js\"></script>\n<script>\n    // Rows carry ids so an automated check can name the field it fills.\n    // The counter only ever increases and is never reused: numbering from the\n    // row COUNT re-issues an id after a middle row is removed, and two elements\n    // sharing an id make every selector for it ambiguous.\n    let debtRowSeq = 1;   // the static first row is 1\n    function addDebtRow() {\n        const n = ++debtRowSeq;\n        const div = document.createElement('div');\n        div.className = 'debt-row';\n        div.innerHTML = `\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"d-name-${n}\" placeholder=\"e.g. Store Card\" class=\"d-name\">\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"d-bal-${n}\" placeholder=\"Balance (£)\" class=\"d-bal\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"d-rate-${n}\" placeholder=\"APR (%)\" class=\"d-rate\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"d-months-${n}\" placeholder=\"Months Left\" class=\"d-months\" oninput=\"calcRisk()\">\n            <button id=\"btn-remove-${n}\" class=\"remove-btn\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove(); calcRisk();\" aria-label=\"Remove debt\">✕</button>\n        `;\n        document.getElementById('debt-list').appendChild(div);\n    }\n\n    function calcRisk() {\n        const bals = document.getElementsByClassName('d-bal');\n        const rates = document.getElementsByClassName('d-rate');\n        const months = document.getElementsByClassName('d-months');\n\n        let totalBal = 0;\n        let oldTotalInterest = 0;\n\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < bals.length; i++) {\n            let p = parseFloat(bals[i].value) || 0;\n            let ratePct = parseFloat(rates[i].value) || 0;\n            let n = parseFloat(months[i].value) || 0;\n\n            if (p > 0) {\n                totalBal += p;\n                if (ratePct >= 0 && n > 0) {\n                    // Shared engine (assets/js/calculators.js); 0% adds no interest.\n                    oldTotalInterest += calculateAmortization(p, ratePct, n / 12).interest;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n\n        const newRatePct = parseFloat(document.getElementById('new-rate').value) || 0;\n        const newYears = parseFloat(document.getElementById('new-term').value) || 0;\n        const newN = newYears * 12;\n\n        let newMonthly = 0;\n        let newTotalInterest = 0;\n\n        if (totalBal > 0 && newRatePct >= 0 && newN > 0) {\n            const consolidated = calculateAmortization(totalBal, newRatePct, newYears);\n            newMonthly = consolidated.monthly;\n            newTotalInterest = consolidated.interest;\n        }\n\n        \n        const gbp = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB', { style: 'currency', currency: 'GBP' });\n\n        document.getElementById('curr-total-bal').innerText = gbp.format(totalBal);\n        document.getElementById('old-int').innerText = gbp.format(oldTotalInterest);\n        document.getElementById('new-monthly').innerText = gbp.format(newMonthly);\n        document.getElementById('new-int').innerText = gbp.format(newTotalInterest);\n\n        const verdict = document.getElementById('verdict');\n\n        if (totalBal > 0 && newN > 0) {\n            if (newTotalInterest > oldTotalInterest) {\n                verdict.innerText = `⚠️ Term Extension Risk: Consolidating will cost you ${gbp.format(newTotalInterest - oldTotalInterest)} MORE in total interest.`;\n                verdict.style.backgroundColor = '#fed7d7';\n                verdict.style.color = '#9b2c2c';\n            } else {\n                verdict.innerText = `✅ Interest Saving: Consolidating will save you ${gbp.format(oldTotalInterest - newTotalInterest)} in total interest.`;\n                verdict.style.backgroundColor = '#c6f6d5';\n                verdict.style.color = '#22543d';\n            }\n        } else {\n            verdict.innerText = '';\n            verdict.style.backgroundColor = 'transparent';\n        }\n    }\n</script>", "fields": {"heading_1": "1. Your Current Debts", "button_1": "+ Add Another Debt", "heading_2": "2. Proposed Consolidation Loan", "label_1": "New Loan APR (%)", "label_2": "New Term (Years)", "heading_3": "Current Situation", "heading_4": "Consolidated Loan"}, "schema": {"fields": {"heading_1": {"type": "text", "source": "llm", "fallback": "1. Your Current Debts", "required": true, "llm_guidance": "A heading inside the calculator panel. Name what this part of the tool does in plain words. No negation, no aphorism, sentence case."}, "button_1": {"type": "text", "source": "llm", "fallback": "+ Add Another Debt", "required": true, "llm_guidance": "Button text. An imperative verb is correct here — buttons are instructions. One or two words."}, "heading_2": {"type": "text", "source": "llm", "fallback": "2. Proposed Consolidation Loan", "required": true, "llm_guidance": "A heading inside the calculator panel. Name what this part of the tool does in plain words. No negation, no aphorism, sentence case."}, "label_1": {"type": "text", "source": "llm", "fallback": "New Loan APR (%)", "required": true, "llm_guidance": "LOAD-BEARING COPY: this is the visible label a reader uses to decide what number to type, and the arithmetic oracle asserts against it. Changing what it MEANS (not just its wording) silently changes what users believe the calculator computes. Reword for voice only; never change the quantity it names, its unit, or its currency marker."}, "label_2": {"type": "text", "source": "llm", "fallback": "New Term (Years)", "required": true, "llm_guidance": "LOAD-BEARING COPY: this is the visible label a reader uses to decide what number to type, and the arithmetic oracle asserts against it. Changing what it MEANS (not just its wording) silently changes what users believe the calculator computes. Reword for voice only; never change the quantity it names, its unit, or its currency marker."}, "heading_3": {"type": "text", "source": "llm", "fallback": "Current Situ